# Agent & Assistant Rules for Garage

Before attempting any code modification, you must consult .agent_manifest.json to identify the architectural pattern and the specific files responsible for data flow. Do not guess file paths.

At the end of each session where code files, features, or architectural patterns were added, modified, or deleted, update .agent_manifest.json to reflect the changes.

Always maintain strict 100% FOSS compliance (no Google Play Services, Firebase, ML Kit, AdMob, or proprietary SDKs).
